            "title": "U.S. Will Seek To Extradite Huawei CFO Meng Wanzhou, Canadian ...",
            "snippets": [
              "- Keyboard shortcuts for audio player\n\n**U.S. Will Seek To Extradite Huawei CFO Meng Wanzhou, Canadian Diplomat Says** **In response, China warns it will retaliate if Canada tries to send Meng to the U.S., where she is suspected of committing bank fraud while trying to circumvent U.S. sanctions on Iran.**",
              "# U.S. Will Seek To Extradite Huawei CFO Meng Wanzhou, Canadian Diplomat Says\n### Law\n\nJanuary 22, 2019 9:30 AM ET\n\nBy\n\nBill Chappell\n\nEnlarge this image\n\nThe U.S. faces a Jan. 30 deadline to request extradition from Canada for Huawei executive Meng Wanzhou (center) seen here leaving her home while out on bail in Vancouver. **Ben Nelms/Bloomberg via Getty Images** ****hide caption****\n\n****toggle caption****",
